  "answer": "24",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}(a_k^2+b_k^2)=\\sum_{k=1}^{10}(a_k-b_k)^2+2\\sum_{k=1}^{10}a_kb_k$ 이므로\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}(a_k^2+b_k^2)=10+2\\cdot7=24$$\n이다.",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
