  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(4k-2l)$ 의 값을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "110",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(4k-2l)$에서\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(4k-2l)=4\\cdot\\dfrac{l(l+1)}{2}-2l^2=2l(l+1)-2l^2=2l$$\n이므로 $\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(4k-2l)=\\sum_{l=1}^{10}2l$이다. 따라서\n$$\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(4k-2l)=\\sum_{l=1}^{10}2l=2\\cdot\\dfrac{10\\cdot11}{2}=110$$\n이다.",
