  "answer": "1045",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(3k+l)$에서\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(3k+l)=3\\cdot\\dfrac{l(l+1)}{2}+l^2=\\dfrac32l(l+1)+l^2=\\dfrac52l^2+\\dfrac32l$$\n이므로 $\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(3k+l)=\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\left\\{\\dfrac12(5l^2+3l)\\right\\}$이다.\n$$\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\sum_{k=1}^{l}(3k+l)=\\sum_{l=1}^{10}\\dfrac12(5l^2+3l)=\\dfrac52\\cdot\\dfrac{10\\cdot11\\cdot21}{6}+\\dfrac32\\cdot\\dfrac{10\\cdot11}{2}=1045$$",
