  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$m+n=9$, $mn=20$일 때, $\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\left\\{\\sum_{j=1}^{n}(i+j)\\right\\}$의 값을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "110",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$$\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\left\\{\\sum_{j=1}^{n}(i+j)\\right\\}=\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^{n}i+\\sum_{j=1}^{n}j\\right)$$\n$$=\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\left\\{in+\\dfrac{n(n+1)}{2}\\right\\}$$\n$$=n\\sum_{i=1}^{m}i+\\sum_{i=1}^{m}\\dfrac{n(n+1)}{2}$$\n$$=n\\cdot\\dfrac{m(m+1)}{2}+\\dfrac{n(n+1)}{2}\\cdot m$$\n$$=\\dfrac{mn(m+n+2)}{2}=\\dfrac{20\\cdot11}{2}=110$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
  "id": "FAN-대수-U9-019",
