  "fanType": 9,
  "stdType": "일반항이 k, n에 대한 식인 수열의 합",
  "level": "중",
  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "$\\sum_{k=1}^{n}a_k$가 다음과 같을 때 $\\sum_{k=1}^{10}a_k$를 구하시오.\n\n> $\\left(\\dfrac{n+1}{n}\\right)^2+\\left(\\dfrac{n+2}{n}\\right)^2+\\left(\\dfrac{n+3}{n}\\right)^2+\\cdots+\\left(\\dfrac{2n}{n}\\right)^2$",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$\\dfrac{497}{20}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "수열 $\\left(\\dfrac{n+1}{n}\\right)^2$, $\\left(\\dfrac{n+2}{n}\\right)^2$, $\\left(\\dfrac{n+3}{n}\\right)^2$, $\\cdots$, $\\left(\\dfrac{2n}{n}\\right)^2$ 의 제 $k$항을 $a_k$라 하면\n$$a_k=\\left(\\dfrac{n+k}{n}\\right)^2=\\left(1+\\dfrac kn\\right)^2=1+\\dfrac{2k}{n}+\\dfrac{k^2}{n^2}$$\n이다.\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{n}a_k=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\left(1+\\dfrac{2k}{n}+\\dfrac{k^2}{n^2}\\right)$$\n$$=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}1+\\dfrac2n\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k+\\dfrac{1}{n^2}\\sum_{k=1}^{n}k^2$$\n$$=n+\\dfrac2n\\cdot\\dfrac{n(n+1)}{2}+\\dfrac{1}{n^2}\\cdot\\dfrac{n(n+1)(2n+1)}{6}$$\n$$=\\dfrac{(2n+1)(7n+1)}{6n}$$\n이다.\n즉, $\\sum_{k=1}^{10}a_k=\\dfrac{21\\cdot71}{60}=\\dfrac{497}{20}$ 이다.",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
 {
