  "body": "수열 $\\dfrac{1}{2\\times4},\\ \\dfrac{1}{4\\times6},\\ \\dfrac{1}{6\\times8}\\ \\cdots$ 의 첫째항부터 제 $10$항까지의 합을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$\\dfrac{5}{22}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "수열 $\\dfrac{1}{2\\times4},\\ \\dfrac{1}{4\\times6},\\ \\dfrac{1}{6\\times8}\\ \\cdots$의 일반항을 $a_n$이라 하면 $a_n=\\dfrac{1}{(2n)(2n+2)}$이므로\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\dfrac{1}{(2k)(2k+2)}=\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\dfrac12\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2k}-\\dfrac{1}{2k+2}\\right)$$\n$$=\\dfrac12\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac12-\\dfrac14\\right)+\\left(\\dfrac14-\\dfrac16\\right)+\\cdots+\\left(\\dfrac{1}{20}-\\dfrac{1}{22}\\right)\\right\\}=\\dfrac{5}{22}$$",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
