  "solution": "수열 $\\dfrac{1}{1\\times3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{3\\times5},\\ \\dfrac{1}{5\\times7}\\ \\cdots$의 일반항을 $a_n$이라 하면 $a_n=\\dfrac{1}{(2n-1)(2n+1)}$이므로\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\dfrac{1}{(2k-1)(2k+1)}=\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\dfrac12\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2k-1}-\\dfrac{1}{2k+1}\\right)$$\n$$=\\dfrac12\\left\\{\\left(\\dfrac11-\\dfrac13\\right)+\\left(\\dfrac13-\\dfrac15\\right)+\\cdots+\\left(\\dfrac{1}{19}-\\dfrac{1}{21}\\right)\\right\\}=\\dfrac{10}{21}$$",
