  "stdType": "분수 꼴인 수열의 합",
  "level": "중",
  "kind": "주관식",
  "body": "수열 $\\{a_n\\}$에 대하여 $a_n=\\dfrac16\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{2k+1}{1^2+2^2+3^2+\\cdots+k^2}$이다. $a_m=\\dfrac{20}{21}$일 때, 자연수 $m$의 값을 구하시오.",
  "choices": [],
  "answer": "20",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "$$a_n=\\dfrac16\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{2k+1}{1^2+2^2+3^2+\\cdots+k^2}$$\n$$=\\dfrac16\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{2k+1}{\\dfrac{k(k+1)(2k+1)}{6}}=\\dfrac16\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\dfrac{6}{k(k+1)}$$\n$$=\\sum_{k=1}^{n}\\left(\\dfrac1k-\\dfrac{1}{k+1}\\right)$$\n$$=\\left\\{\\left(1-\\dfrac12\\right)+\\left(\\dfrac12-\\dfrac13\\right)+\\cdots+\\left(\\dfrac1n-\\dfrac{1}{n+1}\\right)\\right\\}$$\n$$=\\left(1-\\dfrac{1}{n+1}\\right)=\\dfrac{n}{n+1}$$\n이다.\n따라서 $a_m=\\dfrac{m}{m+1}=\\dfrac{20}{21}$이므로 $m=20$ 이다.",
  "parent": "",
  "variant": ""
 },
