  "choices": [],
  "answer": "$-1+\\sqrt{11}$",
  "figure": null,
  "solution": "수열 $\\dfrac{1}{1+\\sqrt2},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3},\\ \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt3+\\sqrt4}\\cdots$의 일반항을 $a_n$이라 하면\n$$a_n=\\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt k+\\sqrt{k+1}}=-(\\sqrt k-\\sqrt{k+1})$$\n이다.\n$$\\sum_{k=1}^{10}\\{-(\\sqrt k-\\sqrt{k+1})\\}$$\n$$=-\\{(1-\\sqrt2)+(\\sqrt2-\\sqrt3)+\\cdots+(\\sqrt{10}-\\sqrt{11})\\}$$\n$$=-(1-\\sqrt{11})$$\n이다.",
